<?xml version="1.0"?><iai friendlyname="Internal Anatomy of an Echinoderm " id="00192239" height="421" width="616" hasaudio="0" hascredits="0" lang="E" basecontroltype="SlideShowControl" outlinecolorid="1" skinstyle="standard" skinlib="standard"><slides><slide type="standard" sequence="1" slideid="1"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="1"><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;La estrella de mar exhibe el sistema hidráulico que caracteriza a los equinodermos. Un anillo central conecta unos canales que recorren los brazos y se ramifican en hileras de pies tubulares. Esta red de canales, una cavidad corporal modificada, constituye un esqueleto que permite al animal desplazarse. Cuando se introduce agua a presión en los pies, puede extenderse y fijar sus ventosas sobre una superficie; al contraer los músculos de la base de los pies, puede desplazarse.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Anatomía interna de un equinodermo&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00192239.swf</image><audiofile/><labels><label labelid="0" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="99" y="21"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>79</x><y>73</y></point></points><origin><x>131</x><y>29</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Píloro&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="95" y="22" w="36" h="15"/></label><label labelid="1" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="107" y="40"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>74</x><y>68</y></point></points><origin><x>131</x><y>48</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Ano&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="103" y="41" w="28" h="15"/></label><label labelid="2" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="304" y="42"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-39</x><y>33</y></point></points><origin><x>300</x><y>50</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;La piastra madreporica è una porzione dello scheletro della faccia aborale che, fittamente perforata, mette in comunicazione il sistema acquifero con l&apos;ambiente esterno, consentendo la regolazione della pressione del liquido. Lo scheletro calcareo è costituito da una serie di placche giustapposte, situate immediatamente sotto l&apos;epiderma; da qui il nome di dermascheletro.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Piastra madreporica e dermascheletro&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Madreporito&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="300" y="43" w="69" h="15"/></label><label labelid="3" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="330" y="70"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-35</x><y>29</y></point></points><origin><x>326</x><y>85</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Glándula digestiva&lt;br&gt;(ciego pilórico)&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="326" y="71" w="106" h="28"/></label><label labelid="4" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="345" y="170"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>6</x><y>-41</y></point></points><origin><x>422</x><y>178</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Mancha ocular&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="341" y="171" w="81" h="15"/></label><label labelid="5" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="182" y="245"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>6</x><y>28</y></point></points><origin><x>242</x><y>260</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;La bocca immette in un breve esofago verticale che sfocia nello stomaco, suddiviso in cardiaco e pilorico. Da quest&apos;ultimo si dipartono estroflessioni dette ciechi pilorici, nelle quali il materiale parzialmente digerito nello stomaco viene ulteriormente digerito e assorbito. Alcune specie sono prive di intestino e ano.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Cieco pilorico: digestione&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Estómago&lt;br&gt;pilórico&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="178" y="246" w="64" h="28"/></label><label labelid="6" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="284" y="240"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-6</x><y>21</y></point></points><origin><x>280</x><y>248</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Il sistema nervoso non è centralizzato, ma è costituito da nervi radiali connessi a una rete neurale subepidermica con funzione principalmente sensoriale. La rete nervosa che coordina i movimenti è più profonda. Gli echinodermi ricevono stimoli dall&apos;ambiente attraverso cellule recettrici sparse per il corpo e, nelle stelle di mare, attraverso gruppi di cellule fotosensibili situati alle estremità delle braccia.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Nervo apicale: sistema nervoso e apparato sensoriale&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Nervio apical&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="280" y="241" w="73" h="15"/></label><label labelid="7" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="354" y="257"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-41</x><y>0</y></point></points><origin><x>350</x><y>265</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Oltre che attraverso la superficie dei pedicelli ambulacrali, gli scambi gassosi e l&apos;escrezione avvengono tramite apposite strutture dette papule o branchie dermali; si tratta di sottili estroflessioni del derma che sporgono dalla superficie dell&apos;animale mettendo in comunicazione la cavità corporea con l&apos;ambiente esterno.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Branchie dermali: respirazione ed escrezione&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Espina&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="350" y="258" w="41" h="15"/></label><label labelid="8" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="355" y="304"/><leaderline forecolorid="4" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-37</x><y>0</y></point></points><origin><x>351</x><y>312</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Ampolla&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="351" y="305" w="49" h="15"/></label><label labelid="10" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="305" y="374"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>left</side><points><point><x>-6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>-6</x><y>-13</y></point></points><origin><x>301</x><y>382</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Pies ambulacrales&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="301" y="375" w="97" h="15"/></label><label labelid="11" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="197" y="374"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>23</x><y>-17</y></point></points><origin><x>242</x><y>382</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Al di sotto del derma si trova un sottile strato muscolare, che nelle stelle di mare e negli ofiuridei permette la flessione delle braccia. I muscoli dei pedicelli ambulacrali contribuiscono a regolare il flusso del liquido nel sistema acquifero.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Muscoli&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Ventosa&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="193" y="375" w="49" h="15"/></label><label labelid="12" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="181" y="336"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>32</x><y>0</y></point></points><origin><x>231</x><y>351</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Il sistema acquifero è costituito da canali interconnessi, con funzione locomotoria, riempiti di un liquido di composizione simile all&apos;acqua di mare. Dal canale anulare si dipartono 5 o più canali radiali, che si allungano nelle braccia, e il canale petroso, che connette il sistema con l&apos;esterno attraverso la piastra madreporica. I pedicelli ambulacrali sono estroflessioni dei canali radiali; quando vi fluisce il liquido si allungano fino a toccare il suolo. Il loro movimento coordinato permette la locomozione dell&apos;animale. Attraverso la superficie dei pedicelli ambulacrali avviene anche parte degli scambi gassosi e dell&apos;escrezione dei prodotti metabolici.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Sistema acquifero: locomozione, respirazione ed escrezione&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Sistema&lt;br&gt;acuífero&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="177" y="337" w="54" h="28"/></label><label labelid="13" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="2" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="167" y="291"/><leaderline forecolorid="4" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>30</x><y>0</y></point></points><origin><x>210</x><y>299</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Le gonadi sono strutture allungate, disposte parallelamente ai canali radiali ambulacrali. I gameti maturi vengono emessi all&apos;esterno attraverso i gonopori, che si aprono sulla faccia aborale. I sessi sono separati, la fecondazione è esterna e lo sviluppo prevede uno stadio larvale.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;Gonade: riproduzione&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Gónada&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="163" y="292" w="47" h="15"/></label><label labelid="14" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="3" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="34" y="260"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>6</x><y>-106</y></point></points><origin><x>124</x><y>268</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Glándula digestiva&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="24" y="261" w="100" h="15"/></label><label labelid="15" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="1" textbuttonstyleid="1" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="19" y="140"/><leaderline forecolorid="2" bgcolorid="3"><side>right</side><points><point><x>6</x><y>0</y></point><point><x>37</x><y>31</y></point></points><origin><x>64</x><y>148</y></origin></leaderline><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="3"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Ampolla&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="15" y="141" w="49" h="15"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>400</imageheight><imagewidth>460</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;Pop-menu title&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide></slides><slideshowcontrol bottombarbgcolorid="5" textdividerbarcolorid="5" creditsbuttonstyleid="4" resetbuttonstyleid="5" navbuttonstyleid="1" numbermenuitems="0" showpop="0" autoadvance="0" shownavarrows="0" bottombarheight="21"><audiocontrollerstyle bgcolorid="6" progresscolorid="5" guttercolorid="6" graphiccolorid="3" outlinecolorid="4" buttonstyleid="1"/><popmenustyle listtextstyleid="3" displaytextstyleid="3" selectedlisttextstyleid="3" rolllisttextstyleid="3" downlisttextstyleid="3" rolloutlinecolorid="7" displaybgcolorid="3" listbgcolorid="3" listoutlinecolorid="7" displayoutlinecolorid="7" popbuttonstyleid="1"><scrollbarstyle guttercolorid="7" thumbbasecolorid="8" thumbrollcolorid="2" thumbdowncolor